message: "If you use this software, please cite this archived version."
type: software
title: "Verification code for long-wavelength energy relaxation and covariance transfer in pinned harmonic chains"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-11-05"
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Qingyu
    affiliation: "School of Physics and Electronic Engineering, Jiangsu University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/okmath2026/harmonic-chain"
url: "https://github.com/okmath2026/harmonic-chain"
abstract: "Supplementary verification code and recorded computational outputs for a theoretical study of pinned harmonic chains. The package includes symbolic coefficient calculations, deterministic quadrature, finite-dimensional covariance matrix checks, figure-generation scripts, recorded outputs, dependency information and reproduction instructions. The scripts do not constitute trajectory simulations or numerical tests of deterministic long-time comparison theorems."
keywords:
  - energy relaxation
  - harmonic chains
  - rotational noise
  - scalar dispersion
  - doubling map
  - reproducibility
